OL,3,GNEWSACity's students urged to get
OL,4,Ameningitis vaccine
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people in Wolverhampton who are
OL,7,Feligible for a free meningitis vaccine
OL,8,Fare being urged to get it before the
OL,9,Fend of the year.
OL,11,FMeningococcal group B bacteria can
OL,12,Fcause serious, life-threatening
OL,13,Fillnesses, including meningitis and
OL,14,Fsepticaemia.
OL,16,FA one-off NHS vaccination programme was
OL,17,Fintroduced following recent meningitis
OL,18,Foutbreaks in England, but the deadline
OL,19,Ffor first doses is 31 December 2026.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
